      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "10876_saegiru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{高|たか}いビルが{視界|しかい}を{遮|さえぎ}っている。",
      "english": "A tall building is blocking the view.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "10876_saegiru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{木|き}が{風|かぜ}を{遮|さえぎ}ってくれるので、ここは{涼|すず}しい。",
      "english": "The trees block the wind, so it's cool here.",
