  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: Xを{遮|さえぎ}る.\n\nUSAGE:\nSense 1 is used with physical objects like {光|ひかり} (light), {風|かぜ} (wind), {視界|しかい} (view), and {道|みち} (path). Sense 2 is used with speech-related words like {話|はなし} (conversation), {言葉|ことば} (words), and {発言|はつげん} (remarks).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {光|ひかり}を{遮|さえぎ}る: to block the light\n- {視界|しかい}を{遮|さえぎ}る: to obstruct the view\n- {話|はなし}を{遮|さえぎ}る: to interrupt a conversation\n- {言葉|ことば}を{遮|さえぎ}る: to cut someone off mid-sentence\n- {日差|ひざ}しを{遮|さえぎ}る: to block the sunlight",
